          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "Not old, from the length of them. The cloak is pinned at the shoulder with a wire ring, the same ring of wire that is wedged in the cairn up on the hill crown at about knee height — the pair of them, split up, one on the hill in the wind and one down here in the dark.\n\nThere is no wound you can see and no name written anywhere in this room. Whoever did all this did not write the name down. They knew it. They were not building a thing to be read; they were putting somebody somewhere good, and then shutting the door, and it did not occur to them that anyone would ever be standing where you are standing.\n\nThey are not going anywhere. Leave them be. The knife was left out on top for a reason."
              ]
