              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "A clay lamp with a black wick and no oil. A cup. A comb with two teeth gone. That is the whole of it, and it is the same list as half the things wedged into the cairn on the hill — a comb, a cup, small worthless objects carried a long way by somebody who meant something by them.\n\nThe old woman up there has been keeping the identical inventory for years without ever having seen this room. People do the same things. It turns out that is most of what there is to know about people."
