              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "You put the chisel to the next seam and your hands will not do it. Not won't — can't. You had one stone in you and you have spent it, and standing in cold water arguing with your own arms is how people end up face down in it.\n\nThe wall is one stone further open than it was when you came down. That is your whole share of this and it is not nothing. Somebody will be along."
