              "action": "describe",
              "parameters": [
                "You get both hands into a gap and pull until the cold goes out of your fingers, and the wall takes no notice. These are cut blocks, seated dry and square, and a sword is no use and your hands are no use. It wants iron with an edge on it, driven into the seam.\n\nThere is iron with an edge on it in this room. It is in the hand of the thing standing in the water, and he brought it down here for exactly this, and he is not using it."
