              "parameters": [
                "Knee deep and no deeper, and clear enough that you can count the steps going down under it. There is nothing at the bottom but the steps, a great deal of grit, and one boot that has been down there long enough to have stopped being leather.\n\nIt does not drain and it does not rise. Whatever fills it does it slowly and has been doing it since before the wall went up."
